---
title: NovaPulse
member: nisham
year: '2025'
summary: >-
  Voicemail triage for US medical practices: transcribes each message, works
  out what the patient needs and sends urgent calls to the doctor on call.
link: https://revaik.com
featured: true
---
Live in production with more than 130 doctors. It understands medical vocabulary, separates refills, results, symptoms and billing questions, and closes the loop with the patient by SMS. It connects to Epic, Athena and eClinicalWorks.
